    "howItWorks": "/* EACH COLUMN COUNTS, IT DOES NOT SHOW. A column's target is\n   the whole count at its place — 1284 for the ones, 128 for the\n   tens — so 9 -> 10 rolls FORWARD and never back through eight\n   digits. The strip is 0..9 and a second 0. */\nconst to = Math.floor(value / 10 ** place);\nstrip.style.transform = \\"
